---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy & Cookie Policy — Fala Surf & Wind School"
  description="Privacy and cookie policy for the Fala Surf & Wind School website."
  noindex
>
  <header class="bg-navy text-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/en/" class="flex items-center gap-2" aria-label="Home">
        <img
          src="/images/logo.png"
          alt="Fala Surf & Wind School"
          class="h-9 drop-shadow-[0_0_6px_rgba(255,255,255,0.6)]"
        />
      </a>
      <a href="/polityka-prywatnosci" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm" aria-label="Polski">
        <img
          src="/images/flags/pl.svg"
          alt="Polski"
          class="h-6 w-6 rounded-full object-cover ring-2 ring-white/30 hover:ring-white/60 transition-all"
        />
      </a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main-content" class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="legal-prose">
      <h1>Privacy &amp; Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p><em>Last updated: 30 May 2026</em></p>

      <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Fala Surf &amp; Wind School</strong> ("we", "us") operates this website and
        provides surf and windsurf lessons in El Cotillo, Fuerteventura, Spain. For any
        privacy question or to exercise your rights, contact us at
        <a href="mailto:surfer.rogacz@gmail.com">surfer.rogacz@gmail.com</a> or
        <a href="tel:+34612490732">+34&nbsp;612&nbsp;49&nbsp;07&nbsp;32</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>2. What data we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Usage data (analytics):</strong> if you accept analytics cookies, Google
          Analytics 4 collects pseudonymous data about how you use the site (sections viewed,
          clicks on Book, WhatsApp and phone, device type, approximate location, referrer).
          We do not collect your name or email through analytics.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Communications:</strong> if you call, message us on WhatsApp, or email us,
          we process the contact details and content you provide in order to answer you and
          arrange lessons.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
      <p>
        We load analytics cookies <strong>only after you accept them</strong> in our consent
        banner. If you decline (or ignore it), no analytics cookies are set and Google
        Analytics is not loaded.
      </p>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Cookie</th><th>Set by</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Duration</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>_ga</td><td>Google Analytics</td><td>Distinguishes users</td><td>up to 2 years</td></tr>
          <tr><td>_ga_&lt;ID&gt;</td><td>Google Analytics</td><td>Maintains session state</td><td>up to 2 years</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p>
        We store your consent choice in your browser's local storage (key:
        <code>fala-analytics-consent</code>) so we don't ask again. This is not a cookie and
        is not shared.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Legal bases (GDPR)</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Analytics cookies:</strong> your consent (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR). You can
          withdraw it at any time (see section&nbsp;7).
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Responding to your enquiries:</strong> our legitimate interest and/or steps
          to enter into a contract (Art. 6(1)(b)/(f) GDPR).
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Who we share data with</h2>
      <p>We use the following third-party providers:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Google</strong> — Google Analytics and the embedded Google Map.</li>
        <li>
          <strong>Meta</strong> — if you contact us via WhatsApp, Instagram or Facebook
          (governed by Meta's policies).
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        These providers may process data outside the EU/EEA; such transfers rely on the EU–US
        Data Privacy Framework and/or Standard Contractual Clauses.
      </p>

      <h2>6. How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        Google Analytics data is retained for up to 14 months. Messages you send us are kept
        only as long as needed to handle your enquiry.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under the GDPR you can access, rectify, erase, restrict or object to processing of
        your data, request portability, and withdraw consent at any time. To withdraw
        analytics consent, click <strong>"Cookie settings"</strong> in the footer and choose
        Decline. To exercise other rights, contact
        <a href="mailto:surfer.rogacz@gmail.com">surfer.rogacz@gmail.com</a>. You also
        have the right to lodge a complaint with the Spanish Data Protection Agency
        (AEPD, <a href="https://www.aepd.es" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">www.aepd.es</a>).
      </p>

      <h2>8. Children</h2>
      <p>
        The website is not directed at children under 14, and we do not knowingly collect
        their data.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy; the "last updated" date will change accordingly.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-10">
      <a href="/en/" class="text-navy underline">← Back to the site</a>
    </p>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
